# Generated contract artifacts + client are compared byte-for-byte by the
# staleness gates (fastapi-backend/scripts/export_openapi.py --check and the
# `git diff --exit-code src/client` check in .github/workflows/contracts.yml).
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites them to CRLF on checkout,
# so `git status` reports them modified even when the content is identical —
# a false "stale contract" signal. Pin them to LF everywhere.
fastapi-backend/contracts/*.json  text eol=lf
src/client/**                     text eol=lf
